    "Exercise 1 — Valid Number\n",
    "\n",
    "Ask the user for a number.\n",
    "\n",
    "If the user enters text, print:\n",
    "\n",
    "Please enter a valid number\n",
    "\n",
    "If the user enters a valid number, print:\n",
    "\n",
    "Saved!"
   ]
  },
