    "Exercise 3 — File Handling Errors\n",
    "\n",
    "Task:\n",
    "\n",
    "Ask the user for a filename.\n",
    "\n",
    "Try to open it.\n",
    "\n",
    "If the file exists, print:\n",
    "\n",
    "File opened successfully\n",
    "\n",
    "If the file does not exist, print:\n",
    "\n",
    "File not found"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "81c7b73a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
